 "notes": "CardDemo's sign-on (transaction CC00, program COSGN00C): the screen shows the region's APPLID and SYSID (EXEC CICS ASSIGN); ENTER upper-cases the user id and password, reads the user security record and XCTLs an administrator to COADM01C and a user to COMEN01C; a wrong password, an unknown id or an empty field shows the screen again; PF3 says goodbye in plain text. The region's identity is a deployment fact CardDemo does not fix: CARDDEMO / CICA here are illustrative values the case states, given alike to both sides. usrsec.txt is CardDemo's own DUSRSECJ in-stream data. Derived from CardDemo (Apache-2.0; Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates): LICENSE and NOTICE here are the source's own."
